\section{Reduction}
The preceding wall terms are imported from the reviewed definitions.
\[Deltaw=qwall Rwall.\]
This balance is the one used in the reported heat-rate table.

\section{Mixed channel T}
The symbol $Tmix$ labels both a thermocouple temperature channel and an oscillator period in this exported sheet. The source supplies no scoped declaration selecting either meaning.
\[fmix=1/Tmix.\]

\section{Draft}
Let $ydraft$ be an output vector, $Amap$ a matrix, and $xdraft$ a compatible vector.
\[ydraft=Amap xdraft.\]

\section{Reviewed}
Let $yfinal$ be the output vector, $Amap$ the linear operator, and $xfinal$ a compatible vector.
\[yfinal=Amap xfinal.\]

\section{Issued estimate}
Define $Kold$ as flywheel kinetic energy, with mass $mold$ and speed $vold$; the motion is nonrelativistic.
\[Kold=(1/2)mold vold^2.\]
